	(text "SDRAM supply: +3V3 -> FB9 120R -> SDRAM_3V3 (EVKB L25/C297/C224)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1f1063f4-3ec8-4230-9353-6a3d90f9f9bf")
	)
	(text "SEMC_DQS PAD  (EVKB C91, DNP)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2ed0ad1d-2b15-4bad-9478-e9a00aa66b44")
	)
	(text "Layout: length-match CLK/addr/data within the SEMC group, keep both chips close to the BGA, 0.1uF at every VDD/VDDQ pin. JLCPCB: C17672183 (Extended part: one-time loading fee per PCBA order)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 225.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "33d625e6-63f2-4178-8742-02ce5bbb8345")
	)
	(text "U9: SEMC D0..D15 (low half)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a8bb05fc-7303-4894-a3eb-97c588f0c897")
	)
	(text "CLK: one 0R per chip from SEMC_CLK (EVKB R365/R407). EVKB DNP options omitted: CKE pull-down (R213/R135), CS0 pull-up (R90/R145). SEMC_DQS (GPIO_EMC_B1_39) only carries the DNP 10 pF pad C145 (EVKB C91); SEMC_DQS4 left floating, as on the EVKB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 222.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d6b46973-c298-4d0b-8e2b-89a2b6900da9")
	)
	(text "JEDEC x16 TSOP-II-54 pinout, A0..A12 + BA0/1: the 256Mb part is 13 row x 9 column bits (SEMC SDRAMCR0[COL]=9, as on the EVKB). -6 grade = 166MHz (CL3), matching the EVKB SEMC clock. Pin-compatible upgrade: W9825G6KH-6 (512Mb, COL=10, C17672183 - low JLCPCB stock)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 219.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e06b1429-cd98-4946-8954-482258d29ae7")
	)
	(text "U10: SEMC D16..D31 (high half)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 256.54 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e9fdd91d-fbdc-4427-9fd3-c3b5aef51f37")
	)
	(text "2x W9825G6KH-6 (256Mb, 16Mx16) on SEMC as a 32-bit SDRAM, 64 MB total. Same arrangement and part family as the MIMXRT1170-EVKB (U13 = D0..15, U25 = D16..31, W9825G6KH-5I)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f0d4d088-c1be-4466-a6b7-12b3cce84449")
	)
	(text "Optional read-strobe delay: the SDK loops the dummy DQS back from this pad, so leave C145 unfitted unless SDRAM reads need retiming."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 256.54 0)
		(effects
